WEBVTT

00:03.586 --> 00:05.505
- Your name is Tsav.
- Yes.

00:05.588 --> 00:07.007
No surname.

00:07.090 --> 00:08.883
Commonly known as "Man-Eating Ghoul."

00:08.967 --> 00:13.513
Ah, assassins raised
by the Gwen Mohsa Order are all like that.

00:13.596 --> 00:15.849
So you killed eight people in a month?

00:15.932 --> 00:17.809
You really went on a rampage, didn't you?

00:17.892 --> 00:20.395
Oh, that's not true.

00:20.478 --> 00:21.646
I'm an honest man.

00:21.730 --> 00:23.606
So I'll be honest with you.

00:23.690 --> 00:26.693
Actually, I killed 12 people.
You've got to add another 50%.

00:26.776 --> 00:28.153
- What--
- See?

00:28.236 --> 00:30.655
I'm actually honest and a people pleaser.

00:30.739 --> 00:33.867
I'm always given crappy tasks.

00:35.243 --> 00:36.828
You've killed people...

00:36.911 --> 00:39.330
Don't you feel any guilt?

00:40.373 --> 00:43.793
Excuse me,
are we discussing good and evil?

00:43.877 --> 00:47.130
I really don't get stuff like morality.

00:47.213 --> 00:48.214
Of course.

00:48.298 --> 00:51.176
It wouldn't sit right with me
to kill someone I admire.

00:51.259 --> 00:53.845
But other than that,
I don't get any of it.

00:53.928 --> 00:57.474
And the reason why my mind
wasn't affected by the Order

00:57.557 --> 01:01.061
is probably that I'm too stupid
to understand those things.

01:03.146 --> 01:05.190
I know very well how the Order operates.

01:05.273 --> 01:09.861
They use pain, drugs, happiness,
and all sorts of methods on kids to...

01:10.820 --> 01:13.948
Am I some kind of chosen one?

01:14.032 --> 01:17.077
Oh no, that's too much pressure.

01:19.120 --> 01:20.288
Aren't you scared?

01:21.331 --> 01:23.833
If you're lucky,
you'll get life imprisonment.

01:23.917 --> 01:25.376
If not, it's the death penalty.

01:26.002 --> 01:27.295
Aren't you scared?

01:27.962 --> 01:29.255
I'm terrified.

01:29.839 --> 01:32.467
But being scared won't change anything.

01:33.009 --> 01:36.095
So I want to enjoy the moment.

01:36.179 --> 01:38.348
Most people don't think like that.

01:39.265 --> 01:40.892
Do you just have no imagination?

01:40.975 --> 01:42.101
You're so mean!

01:42.185 --> 01:44.771
I got a great imagination, okay?

01:44.854 --> 01:46.189
But...

01:46.272 --> 01:48.608
I don't really understand.

01:48.691 --> 01:52.737
Is there anything more important
than the gains and losses of you

01:53.613 --> 01:55.490
and someone you admire?

02:00.829 --> 02:02.330
This is interesting.

02:03.289 --> 02:04.499
Tsav.

02:05.041 --> 02:08.336
How do you choose who to kill?

02:08.419 --> 02:09.420
No idea.

02:10.046 --> 02:12.090
I kill them if they're easy to deal with.

02:13.925 --> 02:15.468
Easy to deal with?

02:16.386 --> 02:19.305
Well, this man named Taldy

02:19.806 --> 02:25.937
disappeared from his government office
in broad daylight, in just 70 seconds.

02:26.020 --> 02:28.648
Would you call that easy to deal with?

02:28.731 --> 02:31.693
I'm not talking about the method,
but the feeling.

02:32.318 --> 02:35.738
To me, the difficulty of killing
someone isn't much different.

02:35.822 --> 02:37.532
That's why when I have to kill...

02:38.449 --> 02:40.994
I choose someone
I won't feel heartbroken over.

02:42.495 --> 02:44.873
How do you judge that?

02:44.956 --> 02:47.876
I don't know. It's just my intuition.

02:47.959 --> 02:50.503
It feels easy doing it.

02:51.087 --> 02:52.297
I see.

02:57.760 --> 02:59.012
This is great.

02:59.512 --> 03:00.597
Tsav.

03:02.098 --> 03:04.601
- Death is too good for you.
- What?

03:07.854 --> 03:09.772
If there's a punishment worse than death...

03:10.356 --> 03:11.232
That's right.

03:11.316 --> 03:13.526
I am sentencing you to be a hero.

03:13.610 --> 03:16.654
No... No, wait. Wait a minute! A hero is...

03:18.573 --> 03:20.366
Yes, that's right.

03:23.411 --> 03:26.080
You're not even allowed to die.

05:11.060 --> 05:11.936
See?

05:12.020 --> 05:15.273
I'm basically a pushover, aren't I?

05:15.356 --> 05:17.608
The more I investigate my target,
the more I think,

05:17.692 --> 05:20.820
"I can't kill someone like that.
He has a wife and kids!"

05:20.903 --> 05:22.822
that kind of stuff.

05:22.905 --> 05:25.325
- That's why I've never killed my target.
- Can't believe a man like that is a hero...

05:25.408 --> 05:27.618
- But if I've got nothing to show for it,
- Still the same after dying so many times.

05:27.702 --> 05:29.537
- the Order will scold me again.
- I've heard this story dozens of times.

05:29.620 --> 05:32.081
That's why I chopped people
who had nothing to do with it into mince

05:32.165 --> 05:33.166
and brought them back.

05:33.249 --> 05:34.959
- Aren't I the best--
- Tsav.

05:35.043 --> 05:36.419
Shut up.

05:37.211 --> 05:38.463
I'm sorry, bro.

05:38.546 --> 05:40.923
Did I talk too much again?

05:41.007 --> 05:43.593
Why don't we just gag him?

05:43.676 --> 05:47.013
If we sleep in the same room,
he'll talk all night long.

05:47.096 --> 05:49.432
I just can't keep quiet.

05:50.016 --> 05:53.394
Look, guys. Don't I have a tragic past,

05:53.478 --> 05:55.646
having undergone abusive training
in the Order?

05:55.730 --> 05:56.981
Back then, I was locked up
in an underground dungeon--

05:57.065 --> 05:58.024
Shut up!

05:58.107 --> 05:59.358
Don't make me say it again.

05:59.442 --> 06:01.152
See? Xylo is angry.

06:01.235 --> 06:03.738
Whoa! Sorry, bro!

06:04.322 --> 06:06.074
Alright, Dotta, you apologize too.

06:06.991 --> 06:07.992
Why do I have to apologize too?

06:08.076 --> 06:10.745
That's what I hate about you.
Don't you realize that?

06:10.828 --> 06:11.704
Alright, alright.

06:11.788 --> 06:13.664
Dotta, you should learn
to say something witty too.

06:13.748 --> 06:15.458
Alright, hurry up and apologize.

06:30.431 --> 06:32.558
They're pretty close.

06:32.642 --> 06:35.812
At this rate, they'll arrive at night.

06:38.481 --> 06:40.149
Y-Yes.

06:41.859 --> 06:42.777
So?

06:42.860 --> 06:44.946
How many Holy Knights will remain?

06:45.029 --> 06:46.405
About 50.

06:46.489 --> 06:48.574
They're all trustworthy soldiers.

06:49.117 --> 06:50.827
That's not nearly enough.

06:50.910 --> 06:54.330
Though Venetim has also recruited
prisoners from Milnid Jail...

06:54.413 --> 06:55.873
Recruited prisoners?

06:55.957 --> 06:56.999
Through bribery?

06:57.083 --> 06:58.000
Yes.

06:58.084 --> 07:00.753
He said they're all on death row,
so I can do whatever I want with them.

07:01.754 --> 07:04.423
The punishment for criminals is the same,
no matter where they are.

07:04.507 --> 07:05.591
I can see them.

07:05.675 --> 07:07.385
It could be faerie scouts.

07:07.468 --> 07:09.011
Really?

07:09.095 --> 07:10.138
Let me see.

07:18.354 --> 07:20.148
It looks a bit like a dog.

07:20.231 --> 07:22.358
Could it be a cir sith?

07:22.442 --> 07:24.569
He can see at this distance?

07:24.652 --> 07:27.488
His eyesight is beyond human level.

07:27.572 --> 07:29.031
Tsav, can you handle it?

07:29.532 --> 07:31.325
Well, I'll try.

07:31.409 --> 07:32.743
Even if I miss,

07:34.078 --> 07:35.955
please don't kill me.

07:36.539 --> 07:38.916
Is that the Daisy made by Verkle Corp.?

07:39.000 --> 07:42.003
Yes.
It's a sniper weapon tuned by His Majesty.

07:42.920 --> 07:44.964
Ah, but are you sure about this?

07:45.047 --> 07:46.215
Wouldn't it be pitiful
if they had friends--

07:46.299 --> 07:48.176
Can't you shoot
without running your mouth?

07:50.928 --> 07:51.888
Roger that.

08:04.358 --> 08:06.611
How was that? Bull's-eye, right?

08:06.694 --> 08:08.446
Yeah, but there's still more.

08:08.529 --> 08:09.739
Alright, alright...

08:13.284 --> 08:15.620
- Is it okay to leave it to them?
- Another one from the back! Hurry!

08:15.703 --> 08:17.705
- Don't worry about that duo.
- All the enhancements

08:17.788 --> 08:19.332
- They can complete their missions.
- went into range and firepower.

08:19.415 --> 08:21.000
- Especially Tsav's sniping.
- Its rate of fire isn't great.

08:21.083 --> 08:22.960
- I've never seen him miss.
- Hurry up and shoot!

08:23.044 --> 08:24.253
- Alright.
- You got it.

08:24.337 --> 08:27.089
- Now we just need to set up the traps.
- I really am a genius.

08:27.173 --> 08:28.424
Yeah, here comes the next wave.

08:28.508 --> 08:30.009
- You weren't listening, were you?
- What?

08:30.092 --> 08:32.428
You're not giving up
even in this situation?

08:33.137 --> 08:36.474
There's no way I'm letting people
who'd be happy to see us dead run wild.

08:37.058 --> 08:38.142
Besides...

08:38.809 --> 08:41.312
there's still the matter of showing
how useful that person is...

08:43.606 --> 08:44.565
Over there!

08:44.649 --> 08:45.858
- Look, there's more on the side too.
- I heard you're so eager

08:45.942 --> 08:47.235
- Roger that.
- to make a name for yourself

08:47.318 --> 08:49.487
- We haven't killed them all yet.
- that you put your troops in danger.

08:49.570 --> 08:50.738
You're such a slave driver.

08:50.821 --> 08:53.491
What noble family are you from?

08:53.574 --> 08:55.201
- Yes, we're almost done.
- I'm not a noble.

08:55.284 --> 08:56.536
- I think that's it.
- No way.

08:56.619 --> 08:58.704
- Ah, here they come again.
- Would Galtuile let someone

08:58.788 --> 09:00.081
- Roger that.
- like that be a commander?

09:01.582 --> 09:02.792
Is that a faerie?

09:02.875 --> 09:04.293
Oh, you mean
under the shadow of that rock?

09:04.377 --> 09:06.796
- My uncle is the High Priest.
- That's a faerie.

09:07.672 --> 09:10.049
That's practically
the highest rank in the Temple.

09:10.550 --> 09:12.134
No wonder I've never heard of it.

09:12.218 --> 09:14.387
Bro, it's done.

09:14.470 --> 09:16.430
Every shot hit its mark!

09:16.931 --> 09:18.849
Dotta and Tsav, stand by here.

09:19.392 --> 09:20.851
Kivia, let's go.

09:24.605 --> 09:25.856
Take it all out.

09:25.940 --> 09:27.733
We don't have enough equipment here.

09:27.817 --> 09:29.652
The Commander is leaving.

09:29.735 --> 09:31.279
Hurry up and get ready.

09:44.041 --> 09:46.252
I heard you're staying, Commander Kivia.

09:46.919 --> 09:49.505
Can't believe you want to see
the heroes die with your own eyes.

09:49.589 --> 09:51.966
While I find it a bit degrading,

09:52.049 --> 09:53.301
I'll pray for your safety.

09:55.595 --> 09:57.638
I'll pray for your safety too,

09:57.722 --> 09:58.806
Kivia.

09:59.473 --> 10:01.726
Pelmerry. Don't go too far from me.

10:02.435 --> 10:04.061
This guy is the goddess killer.

10:04.145 --> 10:05.187
You...

10:05.271 --> 10:06.606
All right, Hord.

10:06.689 --> 10:07.815
I will not leave your side.

10:09.734 --> 10:14.238
Hord, was I useful in this mission?

10:14.322 --> 10:15.239
You were perfect.

10:15.323 --> 10:16.699
There's no doubt about it.

10:17.575 --> 10:18.868
In that case...

10:19.660 --> 10:22.622
will you say, "As expected of Pelmerry"?

10:23.456 --> 10:25.082
Understood.

10:25.166 --> 10:27.084
As expected of Pelmerry.

10:31.505 --> 10:33.674
We'll take our leave now.

10:41.682 --> 10:43.684
Is that the ninth goddess?

10:43.768 --> 10:45.811
Yes, it's Lady Pelmerry.

10:46.437 --> 10:47.438
The one who made a covenant with her

10:47.521 --> 10:49.357
is the Commander
of the Ninth Order of Holy Knights,

10:49.440 --> 10:51.400
Hord Clivios. You know him, right?

10:51.484 --> 10:55.279
He's said to be an aristocrat
who once owned vast lands in the south.

10:55.363 --> 10:58.824
Clivios's red wine is a high-end product.

10:58.908 --> 10:59.867
However...

10:59.950 --> 11:03.162
What we have here
doesn't look like wine at all...

11:06.248 --> 11:08.334
Gosh, this is tiring.

11:08.417 --> 11:11.045
Are we going to lure
the Demon Lord into this fortress

11:11.128 --> 11:12.922
and detonate these barrels?

11:13.005 --> 11:16.050
Yes, we'll kill Iblis repeatedly
with potent poison.

11:16.133 --> 11:18.552
That means we'll die too, right?

11:19.220 --> 11:20.471
I don't like this.

11:20.971 --> 11:22.640
It's kind of pissing me off.

11:22.723 --> 11:25.476
Should I kill someone?

11:25.559 --> 11:26.519
What?

11:26.602 --> 11:28.604
Kid, what did you just say?

11:29.355 --> 11:30.689
You want to die?

11:32.525 --> 11:35.736
You lowly heroes
shouldn't get carried away--

11:35.820 --> 11:37.446
Stop it, Zofflec!

11:38.572 --> 11:39.532
I get it.

11:43.911 --> 11:46.163
Why did you make a move?

11:46.247 --> 11:47.540
To vent my anger.

11:47.623 --> 11:51.585
Bro, you kick rocks
when you're angry, don't you?

11:51.669 --> 11:53.671
Rocks are different from humans.

11:53.754 --> 11:55.881
Oh, that's human discrimination!

11:55.965 --> 11:58.217
Humans are also part of nature.

11:58.300 --> 12:00.469
Bro, I don't think it's a good idea
for you to favor them.

12:00.553 --> 12:02.513
I have found you, Xylo!

12:02.596 --> 12:04.223
Goddess!

12:04.306 --> 12:06.225
Have you been watching the house?

12:07.393 --> 12:09.019
Let us skip the small talk.

12:09.103 --> 12:11.730
More importantly, you sneaked out
without telling me, didn't you?

12:11.814 --> 12:14.150
That is not something my knight should do.

12:14.233 --> 12:15.443
Lady Teoritta.

12:15.526 --> 12:18.028
We have fulfilled our duty.

12:18.112 --> 12:19.071
Please have mercy on us.

12:25.995 --> 12:27.121
Xylo.

12:27.204 --> 12:30.708
You seem to have had
a fun time doing recon with Kivia.

12:30.791 --> 12:33.419
There's no such thing as "fun recon."

12:33.502 --> 12:35.504
L-Lady Teoritta!

12:35.588 --> 12:37.339
We picked these berries from the forest.

12:38.632 --> 12:40.885
They're pretty sweet.

12:43.429 --> 12:44.680
The two of you went

12:44.763 --> 12:46.182
to the forest together?

12:46.265 --> 12:47.808
To pick berries?

12:48.350 --> 12:50.186
That sounds like fun.

12:50.269 --> 12:51.812
- No, we were just
- You got a map?

12:51.896 --> 12:53.355
- fulfilling our duties.
- Yep.

12:54.440 --> 12:56.192
Xylo, my knight!

12:56.275 --> 12:59.028
- I met the Ninth Order of Holy Knights!
- Bro, here.

13:00.196 --> 13:01.030
I see.

13:01.864 --> 13:04.283
Don't you dare give me "I see"!

13:04.366 --> 13:05.451
Listen up!

13:05.534 --> 13:07.995
Seven times in a day!
That goddess over there

13:08.078 --> 13:10.706
gets her head rubbed seven times!

13:10.789 --> 13:12.333
So what?

13:12.833 --> 13:15.544
I haven't even gotten my head rubbed once!

13:15.628 --> 13:18.005
I'm not asking you to do it seven times,

13:18.088 --> 13:19.548
but at least half of that...

13:20.341 --> 13:23.719
I haven't even gotten my head rubbed once!

13:23.802 --> 13:25.054
Here!

13:27.264 --> 13:28.098
I see.

13:30.267 --> 13:34.146
- Ugh! Why do you not get it, my knight?
- Forget about that.

13:34.230 --> 13:35.814
- I told you to rub my head!
- At this rate,

13:35.898 --> 13:36.982
- Just rub my head!
- we'll be trampled by the faeries,

13:37.066 --> 13:37.900
and it'll all be over.

13:37.983 --> 13:38.859
Commander Kivia.

13:38.943 --> 13:41.570
Some strangers have arrived
at the back gate.

13:41.654 --> 13:43.572
They say they're here to see this man.

13:44.949 --> 13:45.866
Me?

13:48.369 --> 13:49.745
You guys...

13:49.828 --> 13:53.207
I heard something
is approaching this fortress.

13:53.290 --> 13:55.334
We're just lowly miners,

13:55.417 --> 13:57.920
but I'm sure there's something
we can do to help.

14:01.966 --> 14:04.718
You understand our situation, don't you?

14:04.802 --> 14:07.429
You're the king and the heroes
who saved our lives.

14:07.513 --> 14:09.807
It's only natural
that we want to help you.

14:09.890 --> 14:10.891
I'm sorry.

14:10.975 --> 14:13.143
We're neither the king nor heroes.

14:13.686 --> 14:15.020
Go back to your families.

14:15.104 --> 14:17.731
It's also for our own sake.

14:18.607 --> 14:22.111
We're all from villages around here.

14:22.194 --> 14:26.073
After losing the mine,
if this fortress falls too...

14:26.156 --> 14:29.535
We'll lose our food, shelter,
and emotional support.

14:31.912 --> 14:34.957
It's not like I don't understand,
but you barely survived...

14:35.040 --> 14:37.543
You came at the perfect time, my people.

14:37.626 --> 14:39.086
- It's His Majesty!
- You are

14:39.169 --> 14:40.170
- So majestic!
- all warriors

14:40.254 --> 14:41.088
- As majestic as ever!
- of my kingdom.

14:41.171 --> 14:43.257
Warriors in the truest sense of the word!

14:43.340 --> 14:44.508
Your Majesty.

14:44.592 --> 14:46.260
Don't say such nonsense!

14:46.343 --> 14:48.345
What are you talking about,
Commander in Chief Xylo?

14:48.429 --> 14:51.473
We're seriously short on troops right now.

14:51.557 --> 14:52.975
I know that.

14:53.058 --> 14:54.351
But these guys...

14:54.435 --> 14:57.730
Of course, I won't ask you
to sacrifice the lives of my people.

14:57.813 --> 15:00.399
However, they can help me.

15:00.482 --> 15:01.317
What?

15:01.400 --> 15:05.362
No matter how complicated
the sacred seal engraving is,

15:05.446 --> 15:07.448
if they see my blueprint,

15:07.531 --> 15:09.491
anyone can follow it.

15:10.242 --> 15:13.120
With the strength
of my people who obey me,

15:13.203 --> 15:17.416
we can turn this fortress into
an impregnable military stronghold!

15:18.375 --> 15:22.463
And, let's claim
the glory of victory together!

15:24.298 --> 15:26.175
Yes, Your Majesty!

15:26.800 --> 15:27.968
My people!

15:28.052 --> 15:30.638
Begin the work immediately.

15:30.721 --> 15:36.936
Your Majesty...

15:44.777 --> 15:45.611
Alright.

15:45.694 --> 15:48.530
Everything is going
according to plan so far.

15:49.156 --> 15:50.741
Now then, Xylo.

15:50.824 --> 15:52.952
Please explain the details of the plan.

15:54.536 --> 15:59.667
Tatsuya, seal off the underground passage.
Take about twenty Holy Knights with you.

16:01.168 --> 16:02.419
Tsav, take the back door.

16:02.503 --> 16:04.254
If anything approaches, blow it all away.

16:04.338 --> 16:06.090
Oh, so it's my turn, huh?

16:07.007 --> 16:08.717
By the way, where's Dotta?

16:08.801 --> 16:11.095
He has another mission.

16:11.178 --> 16:13.931
Next, the miners will stay
at the rear of the front line

16:14.014 --> 16:16.725
and support the Holy Knights from there.

16:16.809 --> 16:18.560
We've been ordered not to raise
the castle drawbridge.

16:18.644 --> 16:20.104
It's a dangerous position.

16:20.187 --> 16:23.148
There's no need to push yourself.
Just hold out for half a day.

16:23.232 --> 16:26.485
Yes, I'll continue
with the sacred seal tuning.

16:26.568 --> 16:27.861
And then?

16:27.945 --> 16:29.196
What will you do, Xylo?

16:30.823 --> 16:32.074
I'll take the initiative.

16:35.828 --> 16:37.579
I expect nothing less from my bro.

16:37.663 --> 16:38.539
Yeah.

16:38.622 --> 16:40.207
Listen up.

16:40.290 --> 16:42.835
Hold off the faerie's attack
as much as you can.

16:42.918 --> 16:44.795
I'll drag out Iblis's true form.

16:45.462 --> 16:47.673
Before it reaches this fortress,

16:47.756 --> 16:50.050
I'll use the pre-arranged traps

16:50.926 --> 16:52.219
to kill it.

16:53.012 --> 16:54.805
For everyone to survive...

16:55.305 --> 16:56.473
this is the only way.

16:57.349 --> 16:59.018
Are you kidding me?

16:59.101 --> 17:00.144
I'll kill you!

17:00.227 --> 17:01.478
Don't get carried away!

17:02.479 --> 17:05.774
Why must we obey the heroes' orders?

17:05.858 --> 17:08.694
Tell me! Aren't you all worse than humans?

17:08.777 --> 17:10.738
You goddess killer!

17:17.286 --> 17:19.747
Could you please not make my bro angry?

17:20.372 --> 17:23.125
I don't want to get caught
in the crossfire.

17:23.208 --> 17:26.128
W-Why didn't you shoot at me?

17:26.211 --> 17:27.337
What do you mean, "why"?

17:27.421 --> 17:33.135
Because you're big and energetic,
you should be able to do the job properly.

17:37.514 --> 17:38.807
Bro...

17:40.768 --> 17:44.396
Tsav.
I agree that this method is effective...

17:45.105 --> 17:46.523
but don't do it again.

17:51.779 --> 17:53.322
Oh, right.

17:53.405 --> 17:55.115
It's better to just kill him--

17:55.699 --> 17:59.036
No, take him away and stop
the bleeding with a sacred seal.

18:08.212 --> 18:10.089
So, what do you want?

18:10.172 --> 18:13.258
To be honest,
I have a letter addressed to you.

18:13.967 --> 18:15.928
- It's from...
- No.

18:16.011 --> 18:17.387
Burn the letter.

18:18.430 --> 18:19.723
Uh...

18:19.807 --> 18:23.560
It's from Frenci Mastibolt.

18:23.644 --> 18:25.395
Speaking of the Mastibolt family,
if I remember correctly...

18:25.479 --> 18:27.815
they're the night-gaunts
in the south, right?

18:27.898 --> 18:30.275
They said they would lend us their army...

18:30.359 --> 18:33.112
Personally,

18:33.195 --> 18:36.782
I'd like to ask for their help...

18:37.533 --> 18:38.700
If possible...

18:39.493 --> 18:41.662
We're not talking about this anymore.

18:42.704 --> 18:44.790
I-I get it.

18:45.332 --> 18:48.794
It's just unfortunate to lose
those two thousand soldiers...

18:48.877 --> 18:52.089
By the way,
Jayce and Rhyno couldn't make it?

18:52.172 --> 18:54.883
Jayce replied,
"I don't want to tire Nelly out."

18:54.967 --> 18:56.885
"Watch it, or I'll kill you."

18:56.969 --> 18:58.887
Rhyno didn't reply.

18:59.388 --> 19:01.223
Even though he volunteered to be a hero,

19:01.306 --> 19:02.808
he's still as eccentric as ever.

19:02.891 --> 19:04.601
What about the mercenaries?

19:04.685 --> 19:06.520
I tried to contact them.

19:06.603 --> 19:08.272
But if there's no payment...

19:08.355 --> 19:10.357
Dotta is taking care of the money.

19:10.440 --> 19:12.192
I hope he can make it in time...

19:13.777 --> 19:16.029
Okay, quickly take it inside.

19:16.613 --> 19:18.448
- Tie it tightly.
- Let's send the miners away quickly.

19:18.532 --> 19:20.784
- Ready.
- It's truly the end of the world

19:20.868 --> 19:22.578
if even they are forced to fight.

19:24.580 --> 19:25.998
The end of the world...

19:26.748 --> 19:29.042
Your Majesty, what should we do next?

19:29.126 --> 19:29.960
Xylo.

19:30.043 --> 19:32.713
- Hold it like this, I'll set the position.
- If...

19:32.796 --> 19:34.256
- Yes.
- I mean, if...

19:35.048 --> 19:39.386
If someone really wanted
to wipe out humanity...

19:39.469 --> 19:41.054
what would you do?

19:46.518 --> 19:47.394
What?

19:48.604 --> 19:51.773
Xylo, do you like conspiracy theories?

19:52.608 --> 19:54.151
Boring as hell.

19:54.234 --> 19:57.196
You know that strange article you wrote?

19:57.279 --> 20:00.449
It mentioned Demon Lord worshipers,
or coexisters...

20:00.532 --> 20:03.202
No matter how you look at it,
that's fake news, right?

20:03.285 --> 20:06.246
It's natural for you to think that way.

20:07.539 --> 20:10.250
But if there really are
Demon Lord worshipers,

20:10.334 --> 20:13.253
or a faction advocating coexistence
with the Demon Lords,

20:13.337 --> 20:17.132
trying to make humanity lose
from behind the scenes...

20:18.091 --> 20:20.010
Don't you think everything makes sense?

20:20.552 --> 20:24.181
Including this illogical battle order.

20:28.393 --> 20:30.604
If such a person truly exists...

20:31.230 --> 20:34.358
they'd be a scumbag worse than dirt.

20:50.540 --> 20:52.376
The Demon Lord is still far away...

20:53.460 --> 20:54.753
They're here, my knight.

20:55.754 --> 20:56.838
Those are coiste bodhar,

20:57.422 --> 20:59.091
the vanguard of the army.

21:01.176 --> 21:02.135
Alright.

21:02.636 --> 21:04.263
Let's begin.

21:07.557 --> 21:11.103
The survival of humanity
hangs on this battle.

21:11.186 --> 21:13.355
We must protect our homeland!

21:13.897 --> 21:16.066
Everyone, prepare for battle!

21:17.818 --> 21:18.777
That damn king...

21:18.860 --> 21:21.196
I told him to go to the rear
and provide support...

21:21.947 --> 21:24.783
This is it! Fire!

21:35.377 --> 21:36.712
Defensive barricade, activate!

21:52.561 --> 21:54.479
Well done, everyone!

21:54.563 --> 21:57.691
Your attack has severely damaged
the enemy's morale.

22:00.193 --> 22:02.279
Prepare the next volley!

22:02.362 --> 22:03.739
His Majesty.

22:03.822 --> 22:06.033
Isn't he standing too far out?

22:07.909 --> 22:10.162
Venetim. Honestly, if something
happens to His Majesty,

22:10.245 --> 22:12.414
- Here they come! Fire!
-...this fortress is done for.

22:12.497 --> 22:14.958
- Damn it, I missed!
- I tried my best to hold him back,

22:15.042 --> 22:16.668
but he wouldn't listen to me...

22:17.711 --> 22:21.882
If your mouth isn't useful,
then what good are you?

22:22.507 --> 22:25.093
Tsav, you're often rude to me.

22:26.845 --> 22:28.263
Clear a path for the cavalry!

22:28.346 --> 22:31.266
Begin supporting Commander Kivia
and the others! Fire!

22:34.227 --> 22:35.062
Let's go,

22:35.145 --> 22:37.022
Thirteenth Order of the Holy Knights!

22:37.105 --> 22:39.858
Charge!

23:03.840 --> 23:05.842
- Zofflec!
- Roger!

23:05.926 --> 23:08.386
All forces, turn around!

23:09.596 --> 23:12.724
Disrupt them!
Don't let them get near the fortress!

23:14.434 --> 23:17.479
Kivia and the others are pretty good.

23:18.396 --> 23:19.356
Bro!

23:19.439 --> 23:20.774
What's that?

23:24.236 --> 23:26.196
That's...

23:27.280 --> 23:30.242
Yes. I've confirmed it on my end too.

23:35.747 --> 23:37.582
I don't want to believe it, but...

23:38.875 --> 23:40.627
- They're human.
- Are they human?

23:43.630 --> 23:44.464
Fire arrows!

23:44.548 --> 23:47.050
- Watch out!
- The defensive barricade is on fire!

23:47.801 --> 23:48.635
This is bad!

23:48.718 --> 23:51.972
The sacred seal won't work like this!

23:52.055 --> 23:53.682
Retrieve the barrels! They'll ignite!

23:57.811 --> 23:59.312
The second wave is coming!

23:59.396 --> 24:00.689
There are too many of them!

24:00.772 --> 24:02.649
We can't withstand the next wave.

24:02.732 --> 24:04.234
Damn it...

24:04.317 --> 24:06.736
The front gate can't hold much longer.

24:06.820 --> 24:07.988
They're breaking through!

24:10.365 --> 24:11.825
Damn it...

24:11.908 --> 24:12.742
At this rate,

24:12.826 --> 24:14.286
- They're in!
-...before the Demon Lord

24:14.369 --> 24:15.620
- Put out the fire!
- appears...

24:24.713 --> 24:26.590
We'll all be wiped out!
